and no second opinion when the first one is wrong."],"features":["Multiple independent reviewers. Each AI reads the document in parallel without seeing the others' output. The perspectives stay genuinely independent.","One Builder. A single AI is responsible for merging suggestions into a new version each round. You pick which AI does that job, and you can swap it any time.","Conflicts surfaced, not silently averaged. When reviewers disagree, the Builder flags it and you decide.","Iterative convergence. Rounds continue until reviewers stop proposing changes — typically 5–20 rounds, depending on starting quality and document complexity.","Human oversight at every stage. You read the result, resolve conflicts, optionally add per-round Notes, and call the finish line."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WeirDave/WaxFrame-Professional/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"799b06c6b5dcce03b5785f5e50a0d850234405eaf3e242a5c3496b6d3ac8843b","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:21.490Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:21.490Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Multi-AI document refinement in your browser. The Builder rewrites; the rest of your hive reviews in parallel and surfaces specific suggestions. You resolve disagreements your way, then run another round. Local-first, with no account, document database, telemetry, or install.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WeirDave/WaxFrame-Professional/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Local-first, with no account, document database, telemetry, or install.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WeirDave/WaxFrame-Professional/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"The Builder rewrites the entire document every round and uses significantly more tokens than any reviewer — it needs a paid API plan with real capacity.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WeirDave/WaxFrame-Professional/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status"